{"id":"000VOB","title":"Rashomon","author":"Jorava","solvedCount":0,"difficulty":4,"rating":"N/A","firstSeen":"2026-10-23T18:26:15+00:00","posted":"Heute, 16:41 Uhr","rules":"Two truths and a lie.\n\nSolve in Sudokupad (colorful version)\n\nSolve in Sudokupad (version with fewer colors)\n\n-----\n\nRules:\n\nNormal sudoku rules apply. Place the digits 1-9 in every row, column, and 3x3 box without repetition.\n\nTwo Truths and a Lie:\nEvery 3x3 box has exactly one liar clue. A clue is a liar if its specific restriction is broken at least once. Each liar corresponds to a different clue type.\n\nXV:\nTwo digits separated by X sum to 10. Two digits separated by V sum to 5. X and V are different clue types.\n\nKiller Cages:\nDigits in a cage sum to the value given in the top left corner of the cage.\n\nGerman Whispers:\nAdjacent digits on a green line must differ by at least 5.\n\nArrows:\nDigits along an arrow must sum to the digit in that arrow's attached circle.\n\nKropki:\nDigits separated by a black dot must be in 1:2 ratio (one is double the other).\n\nQuadruples:\nDigits inside a white circle must appear at least once in the four surrounding cells.\n\nModular-3 Lines:\nEvery sequence of three cells on a thick teal line must contain one digit from each of these sets: 147, 258, 369.\n\nBetween Lines:\nEvery digit on a thin line must have a value between the two values in the end circles.","solutionCode":"Column 7","tags":["Sudoku","Kropki","XV (Variante)","Killer (Variante)","Arrows (Variante)","German Whispers (Variante)","Between (Variante)"],"links":[{"url":"https://sudokupad.app/grmai67rlk","kind":"sudokupad"},{"url":"https://sudokupad.app/jklb0igaz9","kind":"sudokupad"}],"data":"","error":null,"settings":{},"link":"https://sudokupad.app/grmai67rlk","linkKind":"sudokupad","summary":{"format":"scl","decoded":true,"rows":9,"cols":9,"cages":3,"hasSolution":true,"features":["lines","arrows","overlays"]},"attempts":0,"fetched":"2026-10-23T18:26:15+00:00"}